#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.merkuro.calendar.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "Merkuro Calendar"
msgstr "Merkuro Kalendar"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.merkuro.calendar.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "Manage your tasks and events with speed and ease"
msgstr "Upravljajte zadacima i događajima brzo i jednostavno"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.merkuro.calendar.metainfo.xml:18
msgid "Merkuro Calendar is a calendar application that allows you to manage your tasks and events. Kalendar supports both local calendars as well as a multitude of online calendars: Nextcloud, Google® Calendar, Outlook®, Caldav, and many more."
msgstr "Merkuro Kalendar je kalendarska aplikacija koja vam omogućuje upravljanje zadacima i događajima. Kalendar podržava lokalne kalendare, kao i brojne mrežne kalendare: Nextcloud, Google® Kalendar, Outlook®, Caldav i mnoge druge."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.merkuro.calendar.metainfo.xml:19
msgid "Merkuro gives you many ways to interact with your events. The month view provides an overview of the entire month; the week view presents a detailed hour-by-hour overview of your week; and the schedule view lists all of your upcoming events so that you can easily and quickly plan ahead."
msgstr "Merkuro nudi mnogo načina za rad s događajima. Mjesečni prikaz daje pregled cijelog mjeseca; tjedni prikaz prikazuje detaljan pregled tjedna po satima, a prikaz rasporeda navodi sve nadolazeće događaje kako biste jednostavno i brzo mogli planirati unaprijed."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.merkuro.calendar.metainfo.xml:20
msgid "A tasks view is also available, making it possible for you to manage your tasks and subtasks with Merkuro's powerful tree view and its customisable filtering capabilities."
msgstr "Dostupan je i prikaz zadataka koji vam omogućuje upravljanje zadacima i podzadacima pomoću Merkurova moćnog stablastog prikaza i prilagodljivih mogućnosti filtriranja."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.merkuro.calendar.metainfo.xml:21
msgid "Merkuro was built with the idea to be usable on desktop, on mobile and everything in between."
msgstr "Merkuro je osmišljen za korištenje na stolnim i mobilnim uređajima te svemu između."

